        "text": "I have used Mavpro on several projects and the work has always been very professional.",
        "time": 1770297847,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anne McGuigan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114582720327947540058/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocInC21CBgErUBP-g0N7nldJX8MjfGE7VKUK9mChDZvb43V6MA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a week ago",
        "text": "Matthew has been my contractor for 11 years now. I met him when our real estate agent asked him to do some last minute painting before putting our former house 🏡 on the market. Every room in the new  house we bought has been touched by Matthew and his crew in one manner or another. There isn’t anything he can’t do, from painting, plastering, changing doors, bathroom renos, kitchen renos and the list goes on. He has even helped me out with some small jobs for which I am very grateful. The quality of his work is stellar and he always works in a timely fashion.\nMatthew is personable, honest, kind and happy to share his expertise when the homeowner is making a design and/or functionality decision. He guarantees his work, with good reason.\nCan’t say enough but I will stop there. Thank you, Matthew, thank you! .",
        "time": 1770242115,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lauren Venditti",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114006219889489648730/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJin_B_w1-EzCegdGVhVW0ak7Y5PofMyd4xrryHI2oCgSIFC1TG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a week ago",
        "text": "We've used MavPro for multiple projects and just recently our master bathroom. The end to end process was smooth, the team is super friendly, tidy and professional. Matt and his team come with years of experience and highly recommend their work.",
        "time": 1770238065,
